## Phase Dependencies

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    P0["Phase 0\nCleanup & Abstraction"] --> P1["Phase 1\nContextual Chunking"]
    P0 --> P2["Phase 2\nBatched Retrieval + RRF"]
    P1 --> P2
    P2 --> P3["Phase 3\nReranker Gating +\nMicro-Batch Compliance"]
    P3 --> P4["Phase 4\nCaching + Citation\n+ Bidirectional Check"]
    P0 --> P5["Phase 5\nEvaluation Benchmark"]
    P4 --> P5
    
    style P0 fill:#ff6b6b,color:#fff
    style P1 fill:#ffa06b,color:#fff
    style P2 fill:#ffd06b,color:#000
