## What We Are NOT Building Yet

| Deferred Item | Why Not Now | When to Revisit |
|---|---|---|
| FastAPI backend | Streamlit works for portfolio demos; decouple when adding multi-user support | After Phase 5 is validated |
| PostgreSQL persistence | In-memory FAISS is fine for single-user; persist when adding audit history | After FastAPI |
| Docker containerization | Local dev is sufficient for now | After FastAPI + PostgreSQL |
| Redis caching | Python dict / `functools.lru_cache` is sufficient at single-user scale | After Docker |
| Kafka / message queues | Zero need at current scale | Only if processing 1000+ contracts/day |
| Multi-agent architecture | Dropped by your decision | Only if workflow genuinely needs it |
| Production deployment | Premature until evaluation baseline is established | After all 5 phases |
